1. Application Control
1.1 Create Control Groups
Create the following groups:



YourName-HighRisk-Apps-Group
Include systems from Engineering & R&D. (choose any machine for test )




YourName-Finance-RestrictedApps
Include Windows 11 endpoints only.(choose any machine for test )​



1.2 Create Allowed & Denied Lists (choose mock list if the apps are not available)
Configure:

Allowed List (choose mock list if the apps are not available)

Microsoft Office

Zoom

Adobe Reader

Custom HR tool (add mock executable path)

Name: YourName-AppControl-AllowList

Denied List (choose mock list if the apps are not available)

AnyDesk

TeamViewer

Torrent clients

Python.exe (for restricted R&D endpoints)

Name: YourName-AppControl-DenyList


1.3 Create Enforcement Policy
Policy name: YourName-AppControl-Policy

Configuration:

Allow only whitelisted applications

Deny execution of blacklisted apps

Enable logging of all blocked attempts

Set mode: Audit-Only (for simulation)


